Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Interpret effective serials, lots, dates, configurations, and authorized exceptions. Distinguish new production from retrofit obligations and preserve fielded units outside scope rather than applying the latest revision universally.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
